01:04:28,302 --> 01:04:30,170
are the only place where
there won't be any spiders.

1274
01:04:30,337 --> 01:04:32,339
-You're right.
-Of course she's not right.

1275
01:04:32,507 --> 01:04:34,441
-You've lost your fucking mind!
-Come here.

1276
01:04:35,008 --> 01:04:37,812
If you want any chance
at salvaging the situation

1277
01:04:37,978 --> 01:04:39,313
and keeping your job,

1278
01:04:39,480 --> 01:04:40,981
