is kind of important.

1279
01:04:41,148 --> 01:04:43,618
And your priority,
at least outwardly,

1280
01:04:43,785 --> 01:04:46,086
has got to be the safety
of your guests.

1281
01:04:47,254 --> 01:04:48,288
Yeah.

1282
01:04:49,022 --> 01:04:50,592
Okay, here's what
we're gonna do.

1283
01:04:50,759 --> 01:04:52,660
We're gonna open that vent,
we're gonna go in,

1284
01:04:52,827 --> 01:04:53,927
we're gonna crawl through,

1285
01:04:54,094 --> 01:04:55,295
we're gonna see if we can
find a way out,

1286
01:04:55,462 --> 01:04:58,198
get his boat, then bring help
for everybody, okay?

1287
01:04:58,365 --> 01:04:59,500
Let's do it.

1288
01:05:01,301 --> 01:05:03,772
(suspenseful music)
(gasping)

1289
01:05:08,275 --> 01:05:10,612
