(gasping)

1290
01:05:14,849 --> 01:05:17,519
(hysterical laughter)

1291
01:05:18,853 --> 01:05:20,487
Oh...

1292
01:05:20,655 --> 01:05:22,724
(gasping)

1293
01:05:24,559 --> 01:05:25,560
(knocking)

1294
01:05:25,727 --> 01:05:27,127
