1301
01:05:52,921 --> 01:05:54,054
Go on then.

1302
01:05:54,221 --> 01:05:55,489
I'll go first.

1303
01:05:55,890 --> 01:05:58,526
Just... don't leave
my dad behind. Promise?

1304
01:05:58,726 --> 01:05:59,861
I promise.

1305
01:06:00,327 --> 01:06:02,897
(dramatic music)

1306
01:06:08,268 --> 01:06:09,503
Ah...

1307
01:06:14,909 --> 01:06:16,845
(gasping)

1308
01:06:22,517 --> 01:06:24,552
(hypnotic music)
Ah...

1309
01:06:24,786 --> 01:06:26,521
(gasping)

1310
01:06:32,794 --> 01:06:35,062
