1363
01:09:15,890 --> 01:09:17,525
Back up!

1364
01:09:17,692 --> 01:09:20,061
Move! Back up! Quick!

1365
01:09:20,227 --> 01:09:22,130
Uh!
(spiders scuttling)

1366
01:09:23,064 --> 01:09:24,699
(panicked gasping)

1367
01:09:24,866 --> 01:09:26,801
(spiders scuttling)

1368
01:09:27,602 --> 01:09:29,302
