I'm alright.

1417
01:12:26,948 --> 01:12:28,049
I'm alright!

1418
01:12:28,649 --> 01:12:30,818
Whoa, ow!

1419
01:12:30,985 --> 01:12:33,154
Get the fuck out of my eye,
you little bastard.

1420
01:12:33,321 --> 01:12:35,056
